---
/**
 * About Section - 简洁说明
 */
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="clawd-container">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2 class="about-title">About ClawdBot (OpenClaw) Platform</h2>
      <p class="about-text">
        ClawdBot (also known as OpenClaw) is an open-source personal AI agent that runs locally on your devices. 
        OpenClaw is built with revolutionary upgrades in voice interaction, visual workspace, and extensible skill ecosystem. 
        ClawdBot provides 24/7 AI assistance for email, calendar, browser automation, and smart home control.
      </p>
      <p class="about-notice">
        <strong>Important Notice:</strong> ClawdBot and OpenClaw (formerly Moltbot) are independent 
        open-source projects. We are not affiliated with Anthropic. This ClawdBot platform provides community 
        resources and documentation to help you deploy your own OpenClaw AI assistant.
      </p>
      <div class="about-cta">
        <a href="https://docs.clawd.bot" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-btn">
          Access Official Documentation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }
  
  .about-content {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .about-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .about-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .about-notice {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .about-notice strong {
    color: var(--coral-bright);
  }
  
  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--coral-bright), var(--coral-mid));
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.3);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .cta-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.5);
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about {
      padding: 3rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
